# Elcroki (22214, level 80; the npc line gives the buff 5080 and the long range DD 4151
# the template lists), every draw 0: a hit above 60% of its hit points wants only the long range DD
# at the character 300 away; a hit under 60% also wants the self range buff on itself (1000000), and the
# DD's weight adds up to 2000000.
character Hunter 20
random always 0
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.individual.Monster.MonsterAI
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WizardBase.WizardBase
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WizardBase.PartyLeaderWizard.PartyLeaderWizard
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WizardBase.PartyLeaderWizard.Elcroki
npc elcroki 22214 Monster 300 0 0 level 80 skill LONG_RANGE_DD_MAGIC1 4151 10 skill SELF_RANGE_DEBUFF1 4486 10 skill SELF_RANGE_BUFF1 5080 1 skill SELF_RANGE_DD_MAGIC1 5178 1 ai LongRangeSkillDist=100,ProbSelfRangeDeBuff1=30,BroadCastRange=100

hit elcroki 10
  desires elcroki cast(player,4151,move)=1000000
hp elcroki 100
hit elcroki 10
  desires elcroki cast(elcroki,5080,move)=1000000 cast(player,4151,move)=2000000
